# 💡 Interview Tips

✅ Use **DFS/Recursion** for path problems.

✅ Use **BFS + Queue** for level-based problems.

✅ Use **Map + Horizontal Distance** for Top/Bottom/Vertical Views.

✅ Right View → last node of each level.

✅ Left View → first node of each level.

✅ Top View → first node at each horizontal distance.

✅ Bottom View → last node at each horizontal distance.

---

# ⚠️ Common Mistakes

❌ Including non-leaf nodes as leaves.

❌ Forgetting to reverse the right boundary.

❌ Confusing Top View with Vertical Traversal.

❌ Using the root as the only possible LCA.

❌ Forgetting horizontal distance while solving view problems.

❌ Not handling an empty tree.

